The regional hybrid classes ecotype_hybrid.py and ecotype_regional.py were
supplied by Xia Hua. In the packaged copy, ecotype_regional.py uses a relative
import of Hybrid; the model equations are unchanged.

The hard-ecotype landscape protocol, phylogenetic tree adapter, effective-clock
propagation, numerical acceleration, latent-history inference and one-region
root proposals were developed by Aobo Wang in this project. Source hashes and
validation records accompany this repository.

The earlier capped-Poisson tree simulator and the fixed-two-offspring seasonal
lottery model use different demographic laws. Observations from the former are
included as a transfer benchmark, not as a same-model validation.

